---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";

const toc = [
  { id: "sec-github", label: "01 GitHub Action" },
  { id: "sec-gitlab", label: "02 GitLab job" },
  { id: "sec-why", label: "03 Why this check" },
];
---

<DocsLayout
  title="CI — Kineti"
  description="Put kineti ship-check and verify in CI. Copy-paste workflow for GitHub Actions and GitLab."
  active="ci"
  {toc}
>
  <section data-doc-section class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line py-10">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-2xl">CI</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      This check is what makes teams adopt Kineti. Make <code class="text-accent">ship-check</code> a required check on the default branch.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="sec-github" data-doc-section aria-labelledby="h-github" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line py-10">
    <h2 id="h-github" class="text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-fg"><span class="mr-2 text-accent">01</span>GitHub Action</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Uses the composite at <code class="text-accent">.github/actions/kineti-receipt</code> on <code class="text-accent">main</code> — no server, same as README.</p>
    <pre class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-none border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-4 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm"><code><span class="text-soft"># .github/workflows/kineti-receipt.yml</span>
<span class="text-soft">name: kineti-receipt</span>
<span class="text-soft">on: [pull_request]</span>
<span class="text-soft">jobs:</span>
  <span class="text-soft">receipt:</span>
    <span class="text-soft">runs-on: ubuntu-latest</span>
    <span class="text-soft">steps:</span>
      <span class="text-soft">- uses: actions/checkout@v4</span>
      <span class="text-soft">- uses: ./.github/actions/kineti-receipt</span>
        <span class="text-soft">with:</span>
          <span class="text-soft">verify-command: "cargo test --all"</span></code></pre>
    <ul class="mt-4 max-w-3xl list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted marker:text-accent">
      <li>With <code class="text-accent">verify-command</code> set, the action runs <code class="text-accent">kineti evidence --cmd "&lt;verify-command&gt;"</code> then <code class="text-accent">ship-check</code> + <code class="text-accent">verify --all</code> — no prior <code class="text-accent">.kineti/</code> needed.</li>
      <li>Without it, run <code class="text-accent">kineti evidence --cmd "..."</code> in a prior step first, then the action runs <code class="text-accent">ship-check</code>/<code class="text-accent">verify</code>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Fails if receipt missing, stale, or fingerprint doesn't match — <a href="/docs/commands" class="text-accent hover:underline">see commands</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="sec-gitlab" data-doc-section aria-labelledby="h-gitlab" class="scroll-mt-20 border-b border-line py-10">
    <h2 id="h-gitlab" class="text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-fg"><span class="mr-2 text-accent">02</span>GitLab job</h2>
    <pre class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-none border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-4 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm"><code><span class="text-soft">kineti:ship-check:</span>
  <span class="text-soft">image: ubuntu:latest</span>
  <span class="text-soft">before_script:</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- apt-get update &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y curl ca-certificates</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- curl -fsSL https://getkineti.com/install.sh | sh -s v0.2.0</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"</span>
  <span class="text-soft">script:</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- kineti ship-check</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- kineti verify --all</span>
  <span class="text-soft">rules:</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == "merge_request_event"</span>
    <span class="text-soft">- if: $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH == $CI_Default_BRANCH</span></code></pre>
  </section>

  <section id="sec-why" data-doc-section aria-labelledby="h-why" class="scroll-mt-20 py-10">
    <h2 id="h-why" class="text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-fg"><span class="mr-2 text-accent">03</span>Why this check</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Without a CI gate, an agent can push code after tests without re-proving it. <code class="text-accent">ship-check</code> compares the file fingerprint at proof time to the current tree and refuses to merge if they differ. Same binary locally and in CI — no hosted gate required for v0.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Hosted gateway + dashboard is waitlist-only (see <a href="/pricing" class="text-accent hover:underline">Pricing</a>). Local flow stays <code class="text-accent">evidence → ship-check → verify</code>.
    </p>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
